==={{TotK|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract/TotK|Chuchu}}
{{Stub|TotK}}
Chuchus reappear in {{TotK}}. The [[Chuchu Jelly|Jelly]] they leave behind can be altered into different types by exposing it to elemental attacks or extreme weather conditions, or can be [[Fuse]]d to weapons or arrows to act as single-use bursts of elemental damage. [[Link]] could also throw Chuchu Jelly to directly apply their effects.

The smallest Chuchus have slightly more health in this game than in {{BotW}}, having 10 health instead of 3.

Chuchus are one of the very few enemies that can be found in all of the world's layers: the [[Sky]], the [[Surface]], and the [[Depths]].

