==={{HWL|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Main|Green Chuchu, Red Chuchu, Yellow Chuchu}}
[[File:HWL Yellow Chuchu Artwork.png|right|80px]]
Chuchus appear as enemies in {{HWL}}, taking on their appearance from {{TWW}}. They come in Green, Red and Yellow varieties. Unlike other enemies, normal attacks are ineffective against them. They can be defeated instantly by using the [[Hammer]] or by being caught in a [[Special Attack]]. If they are hit by the shockwave from the Hammer instead of the Hammer itself, they will be stunned briefly, allowing normal attacks to damage them. They attack by swinging around their head after deflecting base attacks. When defeated, ChuChus will drop items based on their color. Yellow ChuChus will drop a [[Force Fragment]], Green ChucChus will drop a Magic Jar, and Red ChuChus drop Hearts.
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Chuchus in {{AoC}} have the exact same shape and color as the ones in {{BotW}}. A [[Powerful Foe]] version of Chuchus known as [[Giant Chuchu]]s appear in the [[EX Vicious Monster Battle]]s and [[Challenge]]s added in {{PotA}}.<ref name="Nintendo.com"/> They attack by slamming down into the ground, firing out smaller Chuchus, spinning their bodies, and rolling into [[Warrior]]s.
{{Noncanon|End}}

