{{Stub|AoI}}
Chuchus as they appear in {{BotW}} and {{TotK}} are featured in {{AoI}}. They can be regular [[Enemy|Enemies]], though each type of Chuchu also has a [[Giant Chuchu|Giant]] form that can be encountered as [[Powerful Enemy|Powerful Enemies]]. Unlike in {{AoC}}, Giant Chuchus appear in the base version of {{AoI|-}}.

==Trivia==
* The chattering that ChuChus make in {{TWW|-}} are actually overlaid Japanese voice clips, sped up and played in reverse.<ref>{{Cite YouTube|quote= |title= Chuchu arguments|channel= @LovelySoftSnow|date= August 18, 2013|url= https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p33g_wkgGuw|archive= }}</ref>

==Nomenclature==
Chu is Japanese {{Wp|onomatopoeia}} for the sound one makes when giving a kiss, hence the [[Fishman]]'s reference at Pawprint Isle.<ref name="TWW Fishman"/> The name may have once been a reference to the Chuchus' prominent lips in {{MM|-}}.

